---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Trezzit Pricing - Free Bill Splitting"
  description="Trezzit is free for now. Try the receipt demo, use the bill calculator, and start a group without a credit card."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-300">Pricing</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-white">Free, forever - for now.</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-300">
      Premium features arrive once we ship payments. No credit card. No quotas. No surprise Pro wall.
    </p>
    <section class="mt-10 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-slate-950 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Free plan</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-300">Use Trezzit while the product grows.</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
        <li>Receipt demo and bill calculator before signup.</li>
        <li>Saved groups and real receipt scans after signup.</li>
        <li>Itemized splitting, placeholder friends, imports, balances, and settlements.</li>
        <li>No monthly scan quotas in the product today.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <a class="rounded-md bg-brand-500 px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-600" href="https://app.trezzit.com/try-receipt">Try receipt demo</a>
        <a class="rounded-md border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 hover:bg-white/10" href="https://app.trezzit.com/demo">Open bill calculator</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
